From f5c91ed5f9cda73c17427d1fae3077b80d9f34d7 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Michael Bestas <mkbestas@lineageos.org>
Date: Sat, 28 Feb 2026 08:23:24 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] overlay: Update DocumentsUIOverlay

* Enable material3 theme & disable all caps on buttons
* Enable search bar
* Import material3 icons that were reverted in DocumentsUI
  commit 7a0213d95ba08fbe5a3761c48468ea954329a8aa
* Use system fonts instead of hardcoding sans-serif{,-medium}
* Switch to SPDX headers while we are at it

Change-Id: Iae0300c50c08f05163c167cd1ab7d9fe80cc99bc
---

